# Node.js
node_modules/
# front/package-lock.json is COMMITTED: reproducible, pinned installs (`npm ci`) are
# part of the E2EE code-delivery integrity story — a moving dep tree is a supply-chain
# hole. We standardize on npm, so the other package managers' locks stay ignored.
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

